    <h2>Free Tailwind CSS to CSS Converter</h2>
    <p>Convert Tailwind CSS utility classes to standard CSS properties and vice versa. Supports spacing, colors, typography, layout, flexbox, grid, borders, shadows, transitions and more. Real-time conversion with extensive class mappings for all major Tailwind utilities.</p>
